                        <li>Neck: Dimarzio PAF Pro</li>
                        <li>Bridge: Dimarzio X2N</li>
                        <li>Mods: Dual coil split</li>
                    </ul>
                    <li>Squire Classic Vibe Starcaster, Sunburst</li>
